WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.090
Two pictures land on the table.

2
00:00:02.090 --> 00:00:03.320
You choose one.

3
00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:06.020
Then you get 15 minutes to prepare.

4
00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:07.870
You start: «Sur la photo,

5
00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:09.710
il y a…» A beach.

6
00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:11.240
Some young people.

7
00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:13.380
Then your mind goes blank.

8
00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:16.410
You add «On voit…» the sea.

9
00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:19.070
Then nothing. Your teacher is waiting,

10
00:00:19.070 --> 00:00:21.260
and the clock is still running.

11
00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:23.060
So how do you keep talking,

12
00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:25.910
in French, for 7 to 10 minutes?

13
00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:29.700
In this mission, you'll map a
picture with Mission D2's grid:

14
00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:31.810
«au premier plan», «à l'arrière-plan».

15
00:00:31.810 --> 00:00:34.720
Then you'll spin Mission
D4's theme wheel and get

16
00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:37.590
ready for questions on all five themes.

17
00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:40.580
Your mission: work out how
to keep talking in French

18
00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:42.270
for ten whole minutes.
